window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>She was never supposed to walk into my club. But she did. </p> <p>I shouldn’t have looked twice at her. But I did. </p> <p>The criminal underworld is no place for a girl like her. </p> <p>One night with Katerina isn’t enough, but men like me can’t afford to be weak. So, I tell her to leave me behind. She does, but not before she sees something she shouldn’t. </p> <p>When she goes into hiding, it’s my duty to hunt her down. I have a job to do, and she needs to disappear for good. </p> <p>But four years later, Kat isn’t alone anymore. And the little boy right beside her looks just like me. </p>"; 
